{% doc %}
"¿Cuáles te pasan?": the front door of La lista.
Five cards. Each tap shows a line written for that exact combination (31 combinations, three lines each).
From two taps on: "Ver mi resultado" gives a profile (five singles, ten pairs, and El combo completo), the robot, a rule,
tips, a sugar-free fortune cookie and the NUBE moment, with save / share / play again.
The tapped cards go into the sign-up as dolor-* tags (see jc-waitlist).
{% enddoc %}
<div class="jcs-pains" id="jc-pains">
  <h3 class="jcs-pains__title" id="juego">¿Cuáles te pasan?</h3>
  <p class="jcs-pains__ask">Toca las tuyas. Cada combinación tiene su propia respuesta.</p>
  <ul class="jcs-pains__list">
    <li><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-tag="dolor-etiqueta">Lees la etiqueta y no entiendes la mitad.</button></li>
    <li><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-tag="dolor-proteina">Buscas proteína y tu bebida vegetal casi no trae.</button></li>
    <li><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-tag="dolor-dulce">Todo lo «saludable» sabe a postre.</button></li>
    <li><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-tag="dolor-caja">Abres una caja y se te daña antes de terminarla.</button></li>
    <li><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-tag="dolor-noche">A las 11 p.&nbsp;m. abres la nevera buscando algo.</button></li>
  </ul>
  <div class="jcs-pains__combo" hidden aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">
    <p class="jcs-pains__combo-k"><b>0</b> de 5 · Bitácora de los humanos</p>
    <p class="jcs-pains__combo-q"></p>
    <button type="button" class="jcs-pains__combo-again">Otra respuesta <span aria-hidden="true">&#8635;</span></button>
  </div>
  <div class="jcs-pains__score">
    <button type="button" class="jcs-btn jcs-pains__reveal" hidden><span>Ver mi resultado</span><span class="jcs-arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></button>
  </div>
      <div class="jcs-thinking" hidden aria-live="polite">
        <img class="jcs-thinking__face" src="{{ 'jc-face-dato.jpg' | asset_url }}" width="80" height="80" alt="Dato">
        <p class="jcs-thinking__t">Dato está revisando tu caso<span>.</span><span>.</span><span>.</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="jcs-result" hidden aria-live="polite">
        <div class="jcs-result__card">
          <div class="jcs-result__head">
            <img class="jcs-result__face" src="" width="80" height="80" alt="">
            <div><p class="jcs-result__kicker">Te salió</p><p class="jcs-result__title"></p><p class="jcs-result__roast"></p></div>
          </div>
          <p class="jcs-result__bot"></p>
          <p class="jcs-result__rule-k">Tu regla</p>
          <p class="jcs-result__rule"></p>
          <details class="jcs-result__fold" open>
            <summary class="jcs-result__take-k">Para llevar</summary>
            <ul class="jcs-result__take"></ul>
          </details>
          <p class="jcs-result__fortune-k">Tu galleta de la fortuna <span>(sin azúcar)</span></p>
          <p class="jcs-result__fortune"></p>
          <p class="jcs-result__moment"></p>
          <p class="jcs-result__sig">junglcore.com · ¿Cuáles te pasan?</p>
        </div>
        <div class="jcs-result__actions">
          <a class="jcs-btn jcs-result__buy" href="#jcs-home-list"><span>{% if settings.jc_sale_mode == 'a_la_venta' %}Pide tu bolsa{% else %}Avísame · Lote 001{% endif %}</span><span class="jcs-arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
          <button type="button" class="jcs-btn jcs-btn--line jcs-result__save"><span>Guardar mi tarjeta</span><span class="jcs-arrow" aria-hidden="true">&darr;</span></button>
          <button type="button" class="jcs-link jcs-result__share">Mándaselo a alguien &rarr;</button>
          <button type="button" class="jcs-link jcs-result__again">Juega por alguien más &rarr;</button>
        </div>
      </div>
</div>
